        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIVZ2UgYveJXV4dNH-d1dJbUPlNABGzvgLdDBFWVKr8FhtkJg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Poutineville is a go-to spot for comfort food done right, with generous poutines and lots of topping options to match any craving. The fries stay crisp under rich gravy, and the cheese curds hit that perfect squeak, making even the classic feel special. Service is typically fast and friendly, and the vibe is casual and welcoming—great for a quick bite or a late-night feast. If you like bold “loaded” poutines, this place delivers. Omar did a great job hosting us.",
        "time": 1766609223,
        "translated": false
      },
