        "text": "Great experience dining there tonight after our flight delay made us miss our train ride back to Ottawa and we had to rent a car to drive home instead. We were very frustrated, tired, cold and hungry, so we stopped for dinner when we spotted this restaurant on Google Maps shortly after leaving the airport. Our moods are totally lifted now! The high rating and appetizing pictures didn't disappoint either! We were very impressed with the menu and that there's a customization checklist-style menu which we used to order our own delicious creations. We both got the larger portion ($12 for the small; $15 for the large, for some leftovers) and they were impressive and gooey warm goodness. What elevated our visit was the excellent friendly bilingual service from our server, Lexie P. Her enthusiasm and helpful attitude towards newbies to the restaurant was a breath of fresh air. The seating, table, dishes, (lack of loud) music and decor as well as the facilities were all nice too. Highly recommended!",
